{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s29292ac168f477d1","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-38c0ecb91868c9b9ad50","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s29292ac168f477d1","text":"봐봐, 윙. 황금색 목욕물이 하늘에서 내려오는데, 그 안에 얼마나 많은 권력이 담겨 있을까? 빗물은 공평해서 부자에게도, 가난한 사람에게도 똑같이 내리지만, 목욕물은 아니야……","speaker":"깔보는 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"깔보는 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["418391424420375630"],"speakerHashCandidates":["2765553425790137118"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-7342753dcc2026f51199","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s29292ac168f477d1","text":"언젠가 나도 황금색 목욕물에서 목욕하며 만인의 우러름을 받을 거야. 그 정도는 돼야 제대로 된 나비생이라고 할 수 있지, 윙~","speaker":"깔보는 나비","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"깔보는 나비","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["11832902930776763714"],"speakerHashCandidates":["2765553425790137118"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"interaction-p15862","title":"상호작용 기록","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-38c0ecb91868c9b9ad50","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-38c0ecb91868c9b9ad50","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"s29292ac168f477d1","scene":"깔보는 나비","contextId":"wiki-context-7111e252816dbce52cbcc71c","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","revision":72039,"location":[1,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-interaction-p15862-7342753dcc2026f51199"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-7342753dcc2026f51199","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-7342753dcc2026f51199","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"s29292ac168f477d1","scene":"깔보는 나비","contextId":"wiki-context-7111e252816dbce52cbcc71c","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","revision":72039,"location":[1,1],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"}],"unplaced